sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant FE as HROS Web
    participant API as RoleController
    participant Role as RoleModule
    participant Catalog as PermissionCatalog
    participant Impact as ImpactAnalyzer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant Outbox as Outbox

    Admin->>FE: Change Role Permissions
    FE->>API: Preview Role change

    API->>Role: validate proposed Permissions
    Role->>Catalog: Validate dependencies
    Catalog-->>Role: result

    Role->>Role: Verify protected capabilities

    Role->>Impact: estimate affected users
    Impact->>DB: Query Role reach
    DB-->>Impact: affected count
    Impact-->>API: impact

    API-->>FE: Impact preview

    Admin->>FE: Confirm
    FE->>API: Save Role change

    API->>Role: updatePermissions()
    Role->>DB: BEGIN
    Role->>DB: Update Role Permissions + version
    Role->>Outbox: Append authorization audit event
    Role->>DB: COMMIT

    Role->>Redis: Invalidate/replace Role Permission cache

    Role-->>API: Updated
    API-->>FE: Success
